    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No redemption. No surrender. No escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in a mysterious digital world, join Adira in her adventure to face her fears and find a way home.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adira's trusty Double Jump will help you cross large gaps, weave between spikes and climb tall cliffs! Plus, her hammer can pack a powerful punch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solacinity is packed full of useful gizmos to aid Adira in her journey. Restore your jumps mid-air with ReJump Orbs. Take advantage of Springs to launch yourself in certain directions. Face a giant number of other challenges too, like Electricity, Teleportals, and even your own memories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 unique chapters full of unique challenges like a brainwashed fighter or a changing climate!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall down a pit, or collide with Spikes or other obstacles? No worry! You'll be brought right back to the start of the current room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the expansive story of Adira and Solacinity's other wanderers throughout your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solacinity is awaiting your arrival...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277860/extras/5a3b0fab2f7f006765c0375472731c2f.avif?t=1750030872\" data-has-big width=800 height=262 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No redemption. No surrender. No escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in a mysterious digital world, join Adira in her adventure to face her fears and find a way home.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adira's trusty Double Jump will help you cross large gaps, weave between spikes and climb tall cliffs! Plus, her hammer can pack a powerful punch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solacinity is packed full of useful gizmos to aid Adira in her journey. Restore your jumps mid-air with ReJump Orbs. Take advantage of Springs to launch yourself in certain directions. Face a giant number of other challenges too, like Electricity, Teleportals, and even your own memories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 unique chapters full of unique challenges like a brainwashed fighter or a changing climate!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall down a pit, or collide with Spikes or other obstacles? No worry! You'll be brought right back to the start of the current room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the expansive story of Adira and Solacinity's other wanderers throughout your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solacinity is awaiting your arrival...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277860/extras/5a3b0fab2f7f006765c0375472731c2f.avif?t=1750030872\" data-has-big width=800 height=262 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore the strange digital lands of Solacinity! Take advantage of mechanics like Springs, Hammers, Climate Control and more along your journey! Plus, collect enough Stars throughout the main campaign to unlock a special extra campaign!",
